PDO_MYSQL: the MySQL driver of PDO, through mysqlnd. With php84-mysqlnd;
php84-pdo_mysql-openssl is the same for php84-mysqlnd-openssl.

The module pdo_mysql of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20240924/pdo_mysql.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d,
its headers in include/php84/php/ext/pdo_mysql.
